WEBVTT

00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:15,700
We do coffee enemas once a day for years with my first cancer in 2004.

00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,060
I did two a day, the Gonzalez Protocol.

00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:25,620
No, I have CLL, which is chronic lymphocytic leukemia.

00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,900
Should I increase the coffee enemas to two a day?

00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,420
Well, partly that depends on how you're doing.

00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:37,620
And if you feel like you're stable and you're doing well,

00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:42,500
then I would say no. If you feel like you're trending in a little bit in the wrong direction,

00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:52,180
then I would say yes. So I'm just going to go back to what Max Gerson used to talk about coffee enemas.

00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:59,620
That's the way he would have people, and I followed his recommendations in this matter.

00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:05,620
He would have people do up to five coffee enemas a day if they were doing poorly.

00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:12,580
And the whole purpose of that, remember the purpose of the coffee enemas, is to stimulate

00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:20,580
parasympathetics. They're by stimulating the liver to help detoxify and stimulating the gut

00:01:20,580 --> 00:01:26,740
to help detoxify. And you're going to help stimulate parastosis by stimulating parasympathetics.

00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:31,780
And you're going to help stimulate the immune response when you stimulate parasympathetics.

00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:38,100
And you're going to help calm your body and calm your emotions when you stimulate parasympathetics.

00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:45,140
Because your parasympathetic response is a calming response. You'll also open up the vessels,

00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:51,060
you'll decrease blood pressure. There's all these benefits of a parasympathetic response.

00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:56,580
That's the whole purpose of doing coffee enemas. But of course they take time and they're not

00:01:56,660 --> 00:02:02,260
super fun to do. And you're trying to live your life. So you have to have this balance. So

00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:08,660
he would and I have over all these years have said, you know, if you're doing better, you couldn't

00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:14,020
trim down the coffee enemas. When I was doing poorly, I was doing coffee enemas on a daily basis.

00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:23,780
But I rarely did more than one just because I was still working. But now I haven't done a coffee

00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:30,980
enemma for a while. So it's the use of coffee enemas is based upon, and the frequency of coffee enemas,

00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:38,740
I should say, is based upon, you know, where you're at, how well you're doing and guide it that way.

00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:47,060
But you could do anywhere from one only a week to one a day to five a day depending on those factors.

